# Task I: deliver the NMI that snes.hunks (late-nmi-latch) raises when a game
# enables NMI during vblank with the NMI flag still set. The $4200 write arms an
# immediate deadline, so the interpreter returns here at the next instruction
# boundary; take the NMI before anything else, exactly like the field-start one.
# A request left over at a field boundary is dropped: that field's own NMI is
# about to run.
file: runner/src/beam_frame_driver.c

